    <li>asatruLessonIntro->Hear the words of Odin, All-Father, who whispers from the Well of Urd:</li>
    <li>asatruLessonIntro->Lo, the verses of the Völuspá proclaim to all who would listen:</li>
    <li>asatruLessonIntro->Take heed of Thor's hammer as it strikes, for it teaches:</li>
    <li>asatruLessonIntro->Hark, the ravens Huginn and Muninn circle and cry their truth:</li>
    <li>asatruLessonIntro->Under the shade of Yggdrasil, the gods did gather and declare:</li>
    <li>asatruLessonIntro->By the light of Baldr's blessing, know this:</li>
    <li>asatruLessonIntro->On the fjords of the Nine Worlds, wisdom echoes, saying:</li>
    <li>asatruLessonIntro->The runes carved deep into the stones of Midgard teach us thus:</li>
    <li>asatruLessonReinforcement->May your deeds echo in the halls of Valhalla.</li>
